            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ElliexthexCook"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I'm not sure if it was the mango or the recipe but this was far from delicious. I could hardly taste the mango as it was drowned in milk. Next time I think I'll use less milk, a better mango and maybe a bit less honey (I could taste way too much of it).",
