            },
            "reviewBody": "I'm drinking it right know and i love it!\nIt's a perfect comination of fruityness and sweetness my brother loved it.\nI didn't use honey i used white sugar instead. Although if you don't have much of a sweet tooth you can start with less sugar/honey. =]",
